    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Order line vs Quote line variances on new-business deals — total amounts disagree above tolerance.
Why it matters: What sales sold and what billing invoices differ — customers dispute, finance has to reconcile, and one side or the other is wrong by real money on every divergent deal.
Suppress a finding: when the divergence reflects an approved post-quote adjustment.
Disable the detector: only if Q↔O variance is expected. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
